# Sulphur Vent's vent pool A with a suit (CIPlay sulphur_vent_acidsuit, 11-12 w16 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). The suit
# box svsuits (-16 20.5, by the bunkhouse) gives 180 s of suit; straight through pool A (sv_poolA, -20.5 12.5) unhurt.
# Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build.
island Sulphur Vent keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
at -1 20.5 h=11.5
walk -1 20 to -2 16 h=10.3
walk -2 16 to -4 19.5 to -15.5 19.6
use svsuits
walk -15.5 19.6 to -17 17 to -20.5 12.5
wait 6
expect unhurt
walk -20.5 12.5 to -24 8
open Diggers' crate
wait 2
expect item Scrap 3
